Version catalog  Inside `libs.versions.toml` file:  <pre><code>[versions]
zentone = "$version"

[dependencies]
zentone = { group = "com.github.nisrulz", name = "zentone", version.ref = "zentone" }
</code></pre>  Then inside your `build.gradle.kts` file:  <pre><code>dependencies {
  implementation(libs.zentone)
}
</code></pre> Gradle DSL <pre><code>dependencies {
    implementation("com.github.nisrulz:zentone:$version")
}
</code></pre> <p>where <code>$version</code> corresponds to latest version published in </p>
